# --- Avalon physical-game asset discipline ---
# 27 image files in packages/web/public/avalon-assets/ are PLACEHOLDERS.
# The original Indie Boards & Cards artwork is copyrighted and NOT
# distributed in this repo. Contributors who drop real scans for local
# play must NOT commit them. These patterns are explicitly ignored:
packages/web/public/avalon-assets/*-real.jpg
packages/web/public/avalon-assets/*-real.png
packages/web/public/avalon-assets/IBC_*
packages/web/public/avalon-assets/*.original.*
